<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks fall at end-Oct from Sept.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks fall at end-Oct from Sept.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-October rubber stock figures, issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association, with month-earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as follows:</p>
<p> Month	    Oct 96   Sept 96  Oct 95</p>
<p> Stocks	   53,428   54,016   30,568</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p> Crude rubber   47,182   47,873   24,129</p>
<p> Synthetic	 6,153    6,043    6,342</p>
<p> Latex		  93	100	 97</p>
</text>
